#api call for listing employees
###
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/employee/
Accept: application/json

#api call for create employees
###
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/employee/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name":"godu",
    "department":"cs",
    "salary":12000,
    "location":"ekm",
    "email":"godu@gmail.com"
}

#api call for retrieving employees
###
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/employee/1/
Accept: application/json